# TOTP development build

This archive is an unreleased Actions build, not a production GitHub Release.
All binaries target x86 (32-bit). Extract with paths intact into the server root.
The plugin is a SA-MP/open.mp legacy plugin, not a native open.mp component.
Do not load multiple copies. Keep libcrypto beside the server executable.
Include files are provided for both pawno and qawno; use the one for your editor.
This ZIP does not replace your server configuration. Merge the following settings.

## Linux

- plugins/TOTP.so and the x86 libcrypto.so.3 are included.
- Highest GLIBC symbol version required by the plugin/bundled crypto: @glibc@.
- The host needs a compatible 32-bit glibc, ELF loader, libstdc++ and libgcc.
  On Debian/Ubuntu, enable i386 packages and install libc6:i386, libstdc++6:i386,
  libgcc-s1:i386 as needed. These OS runtimes are not replaced by this ZIP.
- SA-MP server.cfg: append TOTP.so to the existing plugins line.
- open.mp config.json: add "TOTP.so" to the pawn.legacy_plugins array.
- TOTP.so uses $ORIGIN/.. to find libcrypto.so.3 in the extracted server root.
- Use the library matching the archive's OS and x86 architecture. No global
  loader-path setup is needed when this directory structure is retained.
